WEBVTT

00:00:09.376 --> 00:00:12.641
I'm not so fundamentally enthusiastic

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:16.382
Even I will participate in this

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:20.153
It's been a long time since we went for a drive

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:22.417
Everyone is excited

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:25.287
He's coming too

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:28.822
I may have no chance with him right now

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:32.563
But I'm definitely going

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:38.603
If you've got a good poker face

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:41.741
There will be something

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:45.812
Let's head to the mountains

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:48.781
We'll just get sunburned at the sea

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:53.920
Even though it's coat season

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:58.357
He is completely misunderstanding

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:02.595
What's going on?

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:06.566
Being this happy

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:14.439
I'm laughing so hard I might burst

00:01:14.808 --> 00:01:22.982
I get choked up when I see his back

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:30.889
In the whirlpool of an endless smile

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:41.201
Episode #5
Every Window

00:01:41.201 --> 00:01:43.837
Episode #5
Every Window
I don't need a life like this,

00:01:43.837 --> 00:01:45.236
Episode #5
Every Window

00:01:46.673 --> 00:01:50.473
a life where I need to kill things
like this to stay alive.

00:01:55.615 --> 00:01:57.378
Ra... Rachel...

00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:00.820
I don't need it! I don't need a life like this!

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:03.584
Rachel! Rachel!

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:05.291
Rachel!

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:06.459
It's no use.

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:08.394
But Rachel's...

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:09.656
Don't you get it?

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:13.632
Right now, Rachel won't listen
to what anyone has to say.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:19.105
And I'm not so sure I want to hold her
hand and head back together

00:02:19.105 --> 00:02:21.130
after seeing her go off on that monster.

00:02:30.383 --> 00:02:33.011
Ahhh, not again... Piece of junk!

00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:39.353
It's my fault... It's my fault that Rachel...

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:41.525
that Rachel...

00:02:43.029 --> 00:02:43.530
It's my fault...

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:44.497
Kate!
It's my fault...

00:02:45.365 --> 00:02:46.662
I'm not waiting for you.

00:02:48.768 --> 00:02:49.826
Damn!

00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:06.207
What are we fighting against?

00:03:06.386 --> 00:03:07.580
The enemy.

00:03:11.224 --> 00:03:16.719
Please tell me. This...
How long is it going to go on?

00:03:17.063 --> 00:03:19.361
Until the objective has been achieved.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:25.467
And so we just keep on fighting
without being told anything?!

00:03:25.638 --> 00:03:27.003
That's correct.

00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:29.209
It's not that simple...

00:03:29.209 --> 00:03:30.938
You either kill or be killed.
It's not that simple...

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:34.341
Even though we're already dead?

00:03:35.548 --> 00:03:37.106
But you're alive, are you not?

00:03:51.598 --> 00:03:54.761
Why me?

00:04:07.146 --> 00:04:12.311
I can still... still...
still smell that monster on me.

00:04:13.419 --> 00:04:16.718
It stinks like rotten meat.

00:04:18.524 --> 00:04:22.862
I can't get the smell out of my nose.

00:04:22.862 --> 00:04:24.489
It sticks there.

00:04:26.899 --> 00:04:29.800
Gross! It feels so disgusting! It reeks!

00:04:31.704 --> 00:04:34.571
I'm so dirty... so dirty...

00:04:35.275 --> 00:04:39.211
This isn't me, I'm...

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:45.281
It's beautiful...

00:04:52.325 --> 00:04:57.661
That's right, I was made to
wear beautiful things.

00:04:58.998 --> 00:05:04.270
I look good wearing sparkling Swarovski.

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:07.034
The sweet fragrance of oriental amber...

00:05:08.141 --> 00:05:09.631
Beautiful...

00:05:10.943 --> 00:05:12.240
I'm...

00:05:18.685 --> 00:05:23.952
No... no... no...

00:05:53.853 --> 00:05:56.981
Well, chicken's low-calorie too
if you take the skin off.

00:05:57.123 --> 00:06:00.149
But that's the best part! All crispy...

00:06:00.727 --> 00:06:02.562
You can cut the fat by boiling it too.

00:06:02.562 --> 00:06:04.325
But then it gets all rubbery.
It's disgusting.

00:06:06.699 --> 00:06:07.700
Aren't you going to eat?

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:09.497
No...

00:06:12.872 --> 00:06:14.362
Are you all right?

00:06:16.809 --> 00:06:20.575
If you don't eat, you won't make
it through the afternoon.

00:06:22.648 --> 00:06:24.172
For the most part...

00:06:26.085 --> 00:06:28.076
Rose? What's wrong?

00:06:33.192 --> 00:06:34.250
Claire...

00:06:39.432 --> 00:06:41.627
Yeah, that one.

00:06:42.568 --> 00:06:44.331
What about this house?

00:06:44.971 --> 00:06:47.906
That's where we died.

00:06:51.811 --> 00:06:53.176
Well, let's go have a look.

00:06:53.579 --> 00:06:55.915
I mean, that geezer Nick's afternoon
lecture is always so damn boring.

00:06:55.915 --> 00:06:56.882
Well...

00:06:57.683 --> 00:06:58.945
What is it?

00:07:00.186 --> 00:07:01.414
Well, I...

00:07:02.822 --> 00:07:07.593
Oh yeah, I have to go pick up my brother.

00:07:07.593 --> 00:07:09.720
Fine, we'll wait for you.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:14.557
We all need to have information,
as much as we can get.

00:07:15.201 --> 00:07:18.438
We need to work together.
We all share this problem.

00:07:18.438 --> 00:07:20.306
But...

00:07:20.306 --> 00:07:27.313
But... Oh yeah, I need to go to a bakery
that's all the way over in the next town.

00:07:27.313 --> 00:07:30.771
Carrie won't eat anything but their
table rolls for breakfast.

00:07:31.717 --> 00:07:32.809
Rose...

00:07:34.454 --> 00:07:39.559
Really, I'd like to go too,
but my brother and sister...

00:07:39.559 --> 00:07:41.427
Fine, then you don't need to come.

00:07:41.427 --> 00:07:43.396
In fact, don't come, you'd just be in the way.

00:07:43.396 --> 00:07:44.797
Claire!

00:07:44.797 --> 00:07:47.061
Don't worry, I understand.

00:07:47.834 --> 00:07:48.823
Claire!

00:07:49.869 --> 00:07:50.836
Claire!

00:07:53.673 --> 00:07:57.165
Really, my brother and sister...

00:08:03.082 --> 00:08:04.709
You didn't have to be that way to her.

00:08:06.018 --> 00:08:07.645
Because she's contradictory.

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:08.912
What?

00:08:09.055 --> 00:08:10.989
And Rachel was saying stuff like

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:13.324
her killing that monster was my fault.

00:08:14.627 --> 00:08:16.356
That kind of stuff pisses me off.

00:08:18.331 --> 00:08:20.128
Everyone needs to take care of themselves.

00:08:23.803 --> 00:08:25.236
Yeah, everyone needs to take
care of themselves.

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:55.262
Morning, Mom.

00:08:55.535 --> 00:08:57.162
Good morning, Rachel.

00:09:13.686 --> 00:09:14.710
Hey, Mom.

00:09:15.054 --> 00:09:15.855
What?

00:09:15.855 --> 00:09:16.844
Last night...
What?

00:09:17.223 --> 00:09:18.190
Huh?

00:09:18.658 --> 00:09:20.558
No, it's nothing.

00:09:21.861 --> 00:09:23.123
You are a strange one.

00:09:27.266 --> 00:09:30.303
So, what are you knitting? Gloves?

00:09:30.303 --> 00:09:31.504
Yep!

00:09:31.504 --> 00:09:33.172
I know you won't like the idea,

00:09:33.172 --> 00:09:37.074
but I was thinking I'd make a matching
set for you, your father and me.

00:09:38.844 --> 00:09:40.004
A matching set?

00:09:40.846 --> 00:09:44.782
I wonder when you're going
to finish making them all?

00:09:45.384 --> 00:09:49.480
Ah, I'd like mine to be pink,
a real catch-your-eye pink.

00:09:50.356 --> 00:09:51.891
So, you'd wear them?

00:09:51.891 --> 00:09:55.294
I'm sure Dad will love his too.
Well, I'm off.

00:09:55.294 --> 00:09:57.029
Oh, you're going out?

00:09:57.029 --> 00:09:58.826
I'm going to study at Amanda's.

00:09:58.931 --> 00:10:00.533
I might be a little late.

00:10:00.533 --> 00:10:02.262
Okay, I'll see you later.

00:10:20.119 --> 00:10:22.755
High-speed curve! High speed curve!
Here we go!

00:10:22.755 --> 00:10:24.586
Wait! Wait!

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:25.625
Yay!

00:10:25.625 --> 00:10:26.887
Yay!

00:10:27.026 --> 00:10:28.391
Faster! Faster!

00:10:29.128 --> 00:10:29.629
Hey!

00:10:29.629 --> 00:10:30.630
Yay!
Hey!

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:31.797
Yay!

00:10:31.797 --> 00:10:32.957
That was fun!

00:10:35.201 --> 00:10:37.692
You two... What do you think you're...

00:10:39.438 --> 00:10:41.774
Oh no, you don't! Look at all the
snacks you have in there!

00:10:41.774 --> 00:10:43.909
Oh oh! Rose is mad!

00:10:43.909 --> 00:10:45.745
Temper, temper!

00:10:45.745 --> 00:10:47.576
Run!
Now wait just a minute!

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:48.981
What do you plan to do with all this?!

00:10:48.981 --> 00:10:49.515
Make sure you buy all the snacks in there!
What do you plan to do with all this?!

00:10:49.515 --> 00:10:50.282
Make sure you buy all the snacks in there!

00:10:50.282 --> 00:10:52.184
Make sure you buy all the snacks in there!
Hey, don't be too loud!

00:10:52.184 --> 00:10:53.953
These are all good!
Hey, don't be too loud!

00:10:53.953 --> 00:10:54.086
Yay! Yay!

00:10:54.086 --> 00:10:55.383
Jeez!
Yay! Yay!

00:10:55.621 --> 00:10:57.223
Let's go get more snacks!

00:10:57.223 --> 00:10:57.890
Yeah!

00:10:57.890 --> 00:10:59.152
Come on, this way!
Yeah!

00:11:19.545 --> 00:11:23.174
I hear you. I can hear you.

00:11:25.785 --> 00:11:28.117
Ah, there you are.

00:11:31.590 --> 00:11:34.889
Come on, come to me.

00:11:35.528 --> 00:11:37.655
You may make a new discovery.

00:11:45.604 --> 00:11:47.299
What are you doing?

00:11:48.641 --> 00:11:50.199
If you're trying to get a hold of Rose,
don't bother. She won't come.

00:11:50.976 --> 00:11:52.773
Uh, well...

00:11:58.684 --> 00:12:00.720
It doesn't look like anyone lives here,

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:02.881
or has lived here for a long time.

00:12:05.191 --> 00:12:07.460
Be careful, Claire.
We have no idea what we'll find...

00:12:07.460 --> 00:12:08.654
Boo!

00:12:10.963 --> 00:12:12.021
What...

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:15.965
Aren't you scared?

00:12:16.635 --> 00:12:17.636
Well...

00:12:17.636 --> 00:12:21.868
I guess the only thing that scares
me is not knowing anything.

00:12:22.208 --> 00:12:23.505
That's about it.

00:12:23.676 --> 00:12:26.543
And once you know,
then what do you plan to do?

00:12:26.679 --> 00:12:31.207
Well, I suppose I'll learn to
play a requiem very well!

00:12:31.617 --> 00:12:33.744
Then I can play it for myself!

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:46.064
Kate, this way!

00:13:11.557 --> 00:13:15.789
Somehow, I seem to remember this place.

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:24.737
Hey, were we already dead then?

00:13:24.737 --> 00:13:26.068
Claire!

00:13:26.438 --> 00:13:27.928
Well, it's the truth.

00:13:28.908 --> 00:13:32.605
Just because it's the truth, doesn't make it right.

00:13:34.246 --> 00:13:37.113
You need to think about us more, Claire.

00:13:37.783 --> 00:13:43.244
We can't all be like you.
We can't all be as strong as you are.

00:13:45.324 --> 00:13:50.887
Just try to understand.
We're all desperate. Rose, Rachel...

00:13:52.131 --> 00:13:53.860
Sounds like a lot of pain.

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:56.430
So, on top of being forced to fight and kill,

00:13:57.002 --> 00:13:58.904
I have to waste my time thinking about
other people's feelings too?

00:13:58.904 --> 00:14:00.506
You don't need to say "other people" like that.

00:14:00.506 --> 00:14:02.174
Hey, you just said it yourself.

00:14:02.174 --> 00:14:02.808
What?!

00:14:02.808 --> 00:14:03.642
"Everyone needs to take care of themselves."
What?!

00:14:03.642 --> 00:14:04.336
"Everyone needs to take care of themselves."

00:14:04.777 --> 00:14:06.005
Yeah, but...

00:14:07.746 --> 00:14:10.044
What was that?! Claire!

00:14:15.621 --> 00:14:18.954
Wait, Claire, something probably just fell.

00:14:19.625 --> 00:14:24.426
Kill or be killed. Kill or be killed.

00:14:25.197 --> 00:14:26.465
Kill or...

00:14:26.465 --> 00:14:29.802
Show yourself!
Quit sneaking around! Show yourself!

00:14:29.802 --> 00:14:30.369
Claire!

00:14:30.369 --> 00:14:31.203
Where are you?! Where are you?!
Get the fuck out here you monster!
Claire!

00:14:31.203 --> 00:14:33.839
Where are you?! Where are you?!
Get the fuck out here you monster!

00:14:33.839 --> 00:14:34.406
Claire!

00:14:34.406 --> 00:14:34.974
I'll take you on any day!
Claire!

00:14:34.974 --> 00:14:35.906
I'll take you on any day!

00:14:36.876 --> 00:14:40.846
Even if you're silent, I can smell your
rotten stench! Where are you?

00:14:40.846 --> 00:14:42.780
Get a hold of yourself, Claire!

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:50.450
Look, it was just a mouse.

00:14:51.390 --> 00:14:52.482
Claire?!

00:15:08.440 --> 00:15:13.173
It's the truth. It's what we
don't know that is scary.

00:15:14.380 --> 00:15:18.248
I want to know because
I don't want to be scared.

00:15:19.952 --> 00:15:21.214
Doesn't it piss you off?

00:15:21.987 --> 00:15:24.046
Having someone else making a bunch of
decisions for you as they please?

00:15:25.157 --> 00:15:26.749
While we are just running around
unable to do anything?

00:15:28.527 --> 00:15:31.826
From now on, I'm the only one
who can make decisions for me.

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:45.844
Hey...

00:15:45.844 --> 00:15:46.811
Huh?

00:15:47.346 --> 00:15:50.474
Why is it so clean?

00:15:50.883 --> 00:15:51.872
What?

00:15:52.151 --> 00:15:54.016
If no one's living here,

00:15:55.020 --> 00:15:57.921
why is this pool so...

00:16:02.127 --> 00:16:04.897
What?! There's nothing but vegetables.

00:16:04.897 --> 00:16:06.732
No way am I eating this.

00:16:06.732 --> 00:16:08.534
I want to have an egg!

00:16:08.534 --> 00:16:10.297
Quit being fussy!

00:16:10.469 --> 00:16:11.993
I'm not a bug!

00:16:13.005 --> 00:16:14.440
Shut up and eat!

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:15.407
Huh?

00:16:16.775 --> 00:16:20.006
Here, here's some mayonnaise.

00:16:20.412 --> 00:16:21.470
I don't need any.

00:16:22.715 --> 00:16:26.515
I don't need a salad, and I don't need you.

00:16:30.222 --> 00:16:31.689
Say "you need me"!

00:16:32.558 --> 00:16:33.425
Rose?

00:16:33.425 --> 00:16:34.159
Say "you need me"!
Rose?

00:16:34.159 --> 00:16:34.955
Say "you need me"!

00:16:36.328 --> 00:16:36.829
I need you!

00:16:36.829 --> 00:16:37.818
Say it again!
I need you!

00:16:38.897 --> 00:16:40.524
Rose, I need you.

00:16:40.899 --> 00:16:42.799
I need you too, Rose!

00:16:44.403 --> 00:16:48.499
You two couldn't get by without me.
You couldn't get by.

00:16:54.079 --> 00:16:58.743
I'm not alone. I can't be like the others.

00:17:00.019 --> 00:17:04.256
Because they're depending on me,
I can't do it.

00:17:04.256 --> 00:17:05.780
They depend on me.

00:17:07.893 --> 00:17:11.030
Hey, you! You wouldn't happen to be alone?

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:12.395
You wanna hang out with us?

00:17:13.298 --> 00:17:15.323
There's this cool little place not far from here.

00:17:17.469 --> 00:17:18.527
Don't touch me.

00:17:20.472 --> 00:17:24.033
Tell me, do I look like I'd be "alone"?

00:17:31.817 --> 00:17:33.052
Oh! Is this Rachel?

00:17:33.052 --> 00:17:33.886
Yeah...

00:17:33.886 --> 00:17:37.014
What a coincidence, I was just
thinking about calling you!

00:17:37.322 --> 00:17:38.357
I'm sorry about the other...

00:17:38.357 --> 00:17:39.224
I want to see you.
I'm sorry about the other...

00:17:39.224 --> 00:17:40.384
Huh?

00:17:42.628 --> 00:17:44.830
Yeah, tonight's going to be great.

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:45.931
To hear you say something like that...

00:17:45.931 --> 00:17:46.665
Hurry here.

00:17:46.665 --> 00:17:47.299
Of course, I'll be right there.
Hurry here.

00:17:47.299 --> 00:17:48.266
Of course, I'll be right there.

00:17:49.034 --> 00:17:50.669
I can see you walking down the street.

00:17:50.669 --> 00:17:51.637
And color of that dress you're wearing tonight...

00:17:51.637 --> 00:17:54.629
Whatever, hurry. I'll be waiting
for you at Russ's.

00:17:57.276 --> 00:18:00.302
I am not alone.

00:18:06.318 --> 00:18:09.188
Yo, Rachel! We're heading to a party at Sally's.

00:18:09.188 --> 00:18:10.956
It sounds like her parents won't
be around tonight.

00:18:10.956 --> 00:18:12.617
We can chill all night long.

00:18:13.225 --> 00:18:14.927
Come on!

00:18:14.927 --> 00:18:16.161
Let's go! Come on!

00:18:16.161 --> 00:18:17.287
Come on!

00:18:18.197 --> 00:18:20.290
Come on, Rachel.

00:18:21.166 --> 00:18:22.401
Move it.

00:18:22.401 --> 00:18:23.235
Huh?

00:18:23.235 --> 00:18:25.066
That's where I sit.

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:26.860
Oh, right...

00:18:31.143 --> 00:18:32.478
Hey, did you hear?!

00:18:32.478 --> 00:18:33.212
What?

00:18:33.212 --> 00:18:34.113
Hardy, that guy from math,
he's getting married!
What?

00:18:34.113 --> 00:18:36.682
Hardy, that guy from math,
he's getting married!

00:18:36.682 --> 00:18:38.283
Really! No way!

00:18:38.283 --> 00:18:39.551
That guy?

00:18:39.551 --> 00:18:41.487
Even someone like that can
find someone to marry!

00:18:41.487 --> 00:18:44.979
At least for the day, can't we
knock off talking about school?

00:18:45.757 --> 00:18:47.122
Hey, Rachel?

00:18:47.826 --> 00:18:49.953
Why didn't you go to that party the other day?

00:18:51.063 --> 00:18:52.397
It was so awesome!

00:18:52.397 --> 00:18:56.168
Totally! And it was packed with cute guys!

00:18:56.168 --> 00:18:58.237
Lately, you've sure been on the prowl,
haven't you?

00:18:58.237 --> 00:19:00.105
No, I haven't!

00:19:00.105 --> 00:19:04.143
I wonder! But there sure were
a lot of hot guys there!

00:19:04.143 --> 00:19:06.512
Yeah, so there are some out there after all!

00:19:06.512 --> 00:19:09.181
Hey! You don't seem to care that
I'm sitting right here!

00:19:09.181 --> 00:19:10.749
Yeah, and you're the hottest of them all!

00:19:10.749 --> 00:19:12.251
What is so amusing?

00:19:12.251 --> 00:19:13.485
I don't know about that.

00:19:13.485 --> 00:19:14.419
Really?

00:19:14.419 --> 00:19:17.055
Speaking of guys,
you exchanged e-mail addresses

00:19:17.055 --> 00:19:17.789
with that guy from that other school, didn't you?

00:19:17.789 --> 00:19:19.158
This is so annoying... so annoying...
so annoying... They are all so...
with that guy from that other school, didn't you?

00:19:19.158 --> 00:19:21.093
This is so annoying... so annoying...
so annoying... They are all so...
Well, he kept glancing at me.

00:19:21.093 --> 00:19:22.993
This is so annoying... so annoying...
so annoying... They are all so...
It wouldn't be nice to just ignore him.

00:19:23.629 --> 00:19:25.731
Well, don't you think you were
kind of "asking for it"?

00:19:25.731 --> 00:19:27.065
Yeah, she totally was!

00:19:27.065 --> 00:19:29.625
Knock it off! You're so mean!

00:19:31.803 --> 00:19:33.405
Stop the car.

00:19:33.405 --> 00:19:35.669
Let me off, I'm going home.

00:19:36.909 --> 00:19:39.845
What's wrong? This is going to be a blast.

00:19:39.845 --> 00:19:42.678
Are you deaf? I said, stop the car!

00:19:43.982 --> 00:19:45.950
Rachel! Stop it!

00:19:47.953 --> 00:19:50.012
Watch out! Stop it!

00:19:50.389 --> 00:19:51.557
Hey, Rachel, do you want to die?!

00:19:51.557 --> 00:19:53.252
Die?!

00:19:57.563 --> 00:19:58.764
Hey, Rachel!

00:19:58.764 --> 00:20:00.322
Luke, let her go!

00:20:00.799 --> 00:20:03.359
What is up with her?!

00:21:09.034 --> 00:21:10.331
I'll see you later.

00:21:28.453 --> 00:21:30.555
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:21:30.555 --> 00:21:32.853
One, two, everybody go!

00:21:40.966 --> 00:21:43.235
The time has come! It hasn't! But still!

00:21:43.235 --> 00:21:45.837
It always starts with the tears in your eyes

00:21:45.837 --> 00:21:47.939
If every weighed-out day

00:21:47.939 --> 00:21:50.142
You leave feeling sick, fly high

00:21:50.142 --> 00:21:51.710
Yesterday's failures? They don't mean a thing!

00:21:51.710 --> 00:21:53.845
Tomorrow's worries? They don't mean a thing!

00:21:53.845 --> 00:21:55.981
What's always important is this moment

00:21:55.981 --> 00:21:58.575
So it goes up to the top, top, top, top

00:22:07.092 --> 00:22:08.827
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:08.827 --> 00:22:10.228
Gather around, my comrades

00:22:10.228 --> 00:22:11.363
If the dream you haven't had doesn't fade away

00:22:11.363 --> 00:22:13.131
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:13.131 --> 00:22:15.000
So don't care, babe!

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:18.637
I'm not going to ask you the reason

00:22:18.637 --> 00:22:22.874
We'll protect you

00:22:22.874 --> 00:22:25.510
So it's okay even if they don't like you

00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:30.015
Even if they laugh at you

00:22:30.015 --> 00:22:33.051
Just keep going down that road you believe in

00:22:33.051 --> 00:22:35.654
Your tears are

00:22:35.654 --> 00:22:39.925
Two of this world's treasures beyond compare

00:22:39.925 --> 00:22:42.694
I will simply keep on singing

00:22:42.694 --> 00:22:49.835
So I won't lose it and it will reach you

00:22:49.835 --> 00:22:52.070
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:52.070 --> 00:22:54.172
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:54.172 --> 00:22:56.402
Rock, rock the LM. C!

